          "alpha": 1,
          "hex": "#fbb605"
        }
      }
    },
    "seq": {
      "$description": "The sequential ramp, for a value quantized to colour (a heatmap cell, a region of a map). Ten steps chosen by hand, from indigo through teal to chartreuse, each lighter than the last. The same in both themes: the common tier says which end is step 1.",
